regarding Tren de Aragua and other transnational criminal organizations and efforts to disseminate information between DHS and other departments, agencies, and law enforcement entities with missions associated with the border.</p>","updateDate":"2025-11-14T15:13:45Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Tren de Aragua Border Security Threat Assessment Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-18T00:02:38Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-30T16:27:18Z"}
